      en: ["Xylokastro is located roughly 120 kilometers west of the Greek capital.", "The Pefkias pine forest is over 2,000 meters long and 100 meters wide.", "The town served as a significant port for the export of currants in the 1800s.", "St. Blaise Church is famous for its intricate interior iconography.", "The 'Ziria' plateau nearby is a popular destination for eco-tourism.", "Xylokastro has hosted international beach volleyball tournaments."],
